context.item:
Permessi `{resource}.{ability}` via Policy `abilities()` + `permissions:sync`; permessi di campo via
      `AbstractResourceAuthorization` registrata in `config/authorization.php` (esempio `InvoicesAuthorization`);
      visibilita' colonna per campo: pattern `COLUMN_FIELDS` + `fieldVisible()` di `CommissionConfigurationsTableDefinition`.
